Models
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

judgly is designed to run on Google's Gemma 4 models (the default is Gemma 4
12B, downloaded from https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/gemma-4-12B-it-GGUF).
Gemma is provided by Google under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma_4_license. The smaller pack
uses Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud, under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (downloaded from
https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507-GGUF). The model weights
are not included in this package: they are downloaded from their publisher on
first use, and their own licence and notices apply to them. "Gemma" is a
trademark of Google LLC and "Qwen" names Alibaba Cloud's models; both are used
here only to describe the model judgly runs on and do not imply endorsement.
Use of Gemma is also subject to Google's Gemma Prohibited Use Policy
(https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy).

