------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This version ships calibration heads inside the packs
(src/judgly/packs/<name>/heads/), two per format (the H2 head and the per-type
temperature, fitted on the same data), licensed as stated in the LICENSE file
next to them:

  general heads ("*")  Apache License 2.0. Fitted on MMLU, CommonsenseQA,
                       StrategyQA, HH-RLHF (MIT); QASC, Cosmos QA, BANKING77,
                       HelpSteer2, LEDGAR as released in LexGLUE (CC BY 4.0);
                       Civil Comments (CC0 1.0); GoEmotions (Apache 2.0); and
                       judgly's own generated tasks.
  stance heads         CC BY-SA 4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt). Fitted on
                       MultiNLI (OANC licence, parts CC BY-SA 3.0 / CC BY 3.0);
                       VitaminC and FEVER (CC BY-SA 3.0), which contain
                       material derived from Wikipedia (Wikipedia contributors,
                       CC BY-SA 3.0 / 4.0); SNLI (CC BY-SA 4.0), which includes
                       Flickr30k captions; WANLI (CC BY 4.0); and SciNLI
                       (CC BY-SA 4.0).

Heads contain no dataset text. Datasets used only for evaluation are not
redistributed; they are downloaded by scripts/prep_tiers.py from their
publishers. Every dataset, its pinned revision, licence and citation is listed
in data/registry.yaml, and the licence evidence is in docs/licences.md.
